stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Community: registration (EUR 0)
    Community --> Active: checkout completed
    Active --> Active: renewal paid, or plan change (license re-issued)
    Active --> PastDue: renewal payment failed
    PastDue --> Active: payment recovered
    PastDue --> Community: grace period over
    Active --> Cancelled: customer cancels
    Cancelled --> Community: paid period ends
    Community --> Revoked: abuse or sanctions hit
    Active --> Revoked: fraud or chargeback
    Revoked --> [*]
